summary.label:
Blood Sugar Master is a lightweight APP for tracking blood sugar levels, designed for smartphones, will help you manage diabetes better and keep it under control Track your health by tracking the evolution of blood sugar trends.



We will also provide you with the function of sharing blood sugar knowledge. Our app only provides the function of recording blood sugar and cannot detect blood sugar. If you need to test blood sugar, please use professional medical equipment.



The current version brings:

- Basic blood sugar tracking by event type (before breakfast, before dinner, after lunch, etc.);

- Filter by historical event type/tag;

- Labels (exercises for tracking reactions, food types, etc.);

- Use and set different blood sugar level units - mg/dl or mmol/l;



Whether you have diabetes or just want to monitor your blood sugar levels, this app is for you.

- User friendly interface

- Easy-to-use features

- Detailed graphs and statistics


Disclaimer: This application is only used as a numerical record and reference, please follow the doctor's diagnosis for related treatment. 
Source: https://medlineplus.gov/diabetes.html
